<title>ESTONIA: BUDGET REVENUES AT 28.1 PCT BY END APRIL.</title>
<headline>BUDGET REVENUES AT 28.1 PCT BY END APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The collection of budget revenue for the first four months of 1997 was at 28.1 percent or 3.6 billion kroons of the planned annual budget, the finance ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>In April, the government collected 7.2 percent of the budget or 905 million kroons, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
